<title>USA: Aerial Communications Inc Q4 loss widens.</title>
<headline>Aerial Communications Inc Q4 loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr	loss	    $0.20     loss	 $0.07</p>
<p> Net	loss	   14,215     loss	 4,299</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  71,355		   59,086</p>
<p>NOTE: No revenues reported. Aerial preparing for launch of personal communications services (PCS) in six major trading areas. First market launch is scheduled to begin in March 1997.</p>
<p>Q4 1996 oper loss $19.6 million vs loss $5.2 million.</p>
<p>Q4 1996 other income $4.2 million, including $2.4 million gain on sale of PCS licenses, vs $20,000.</p>
<p>			YEAR</p>
<p> Shr	loss	    $0.56     loss	 $0.11</p>
<p> Net	loss	   37,921     loss	 6,468</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  67,492		   59,086</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full-year 1996 oper loss $44.0 million vs loss $7.6 million.</p>
<p>Full-year 1996 other income $7.9 million, including $2.6 million gain on sale of PCS licenses, vs $49,000.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
